---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
Run a plugin's test cases in the sandbox, with a fake clock, randomness, environment, network and secrets; exits 1 on a failure

Usage: rustman plugin test [OPTIONS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]
          A plugin folder (with rustman-plugin.toml) or a .wasm file
          
          [default: .]

Options:
      --cases <FILE>
          The test cases (default: rustman-plugin-tests.toml next to the manifest)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
